              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tim pa Solomon man je wok i cako tundo i gike, ondiki i kitawo ma Kigana pa jatuci wac Were Nathan, kodi i Wac ma Were oluwo luwo i dhok Ahija ma wok Silo kodi i Menyirok pa Ido, ma bende luwo kwoŋ dhum pa Yerobowam wod pa Nebat ",
          "type": "text",
